    {
      "start": 19.3,
      "end": 47.2,
      "text": "So I want to introduce you guys to Vibenet You've probably heard us talk about Vibenet tweet about Vibenet but what is Vibenet So Vibenet is Base's experimental preview network That means that new hard fork features go live here first often weeks before they even reach Sepolia or Mainnet For example we're getting ready for 200 millisecond blocks that are already running on Vibenet today while Sepolia is actually planned for later in October",
